# ZenRay Studio

Make a 30 second motion film (or a vertical short of your 3D renders) by changing values, in real time, and export it to MP4 with its music and sound effects. Nothing is reproduced pixel by pixel: every scene is a template, every visible value is a parameter, the browser computes everything live. (15 October 2026)

## Start (15 October 2026)

```bash
open /Users/zenray/Create/Build/Productions/GithubProductions/ZenRayMotionDesign/studio/start.command   # starts the server and opens http://127.0.0.1:3104/
```

or `python3 studio/server.py` then open `http://127.0.0.1:3104/`. The guide is `docs/STUDIO.md`. (15 October 2026)

| Where | What |
|---|---|
| `studio/runtime/zs-templates.js` | the 11 motion templates (title card, prompt and status, kinetic words, big count, list, colour slam, orbit word, gradient word, logo, end card, 3D render showcase), each with at most 4 essential, 8 advanced and 16 expert values |
| `studio/runtime/zs-core.js` | builds a project into DOM and one GSAP timeline (the HyperFrames contract: the same page plays live and renders to MP4) |
| `studio/runtime/zs-audio.js` | generated music and synthesised sound effects (Web Audio), live and offline for the export |
| `studio/web/` | the studio page |
| `studio/server.py` | stores projects and media, exports (HyperFrames render, ffmpeg mux, loudness to -14 LUFS) |
| `studio/presets/` | the starting projects: a 30 s launch film (16:9) and a 3D short (9:16) |
| `studio/params/studio.json` | port, paths, fonts, export settings |
| `studio/tests/` | `node studio/tests/test_runtime.mjs` and `python3 studio/tests/test_studio.py` (green and red, about 10 s) |

## Labs (15 October 2026)

Everything that reproduced references pixel by pixel or sample by sample (vector stacks, music resynthesis and calibration, image fields, rhythm models, SFX corpus, the V1 orchestrator app) moved to `labs/`. It still runs from there (`labs/Scripts/...`, the old app on port 3114) and its history is in `docs/RELEASE-1.1.0.md`, `docs/RELEASE-1.2.0.md` and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. The root `mcp` and `service` are links into `labs/` so the MCP servers and the `com.zenray.motion` LaunchAgent keep their paths. (15 October 2026)
